      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think a longer warning period (one hour is the current warning from experience) for sleeping worlds would be the request to make here, if that's possible.\n\nThe screenshot I provided earlier on the Discord was from August and I've only seen the notice three times, personally. I've had instances open for well over a day before, so it's not 12 hours.\n\nDocumented maximum instance time, if there is one, would be nice to have. If it's used for other situations, like world errors, etc..., it would be nice to know that, too.\n\nFortunately with persistence out in a beta branch, idle game worlds won't be as effected in the future, as they can periodically save your progress per user when it is stable and widely used.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
