      "value": "in a group+ of my own group rn. been about 7 or 8 hours and this is the first time seeing this message. idk what happens after the certain amount of time. i havent gotten this before but it makes sense for why when i wake up in vr, sometimes im at the spawn of whatever world im in. \n\nwhen did this come into affect? do we have more info on what instance types this happens on? what does it mean by reset? does it kick you out of the world or create a fresh instance?",
