  "details": "Hello Everyone,\n\nThe attachment provided, thanks to Slone, is an example of a possibly recent update to VRChat.\n\nDedicated sleep worlds like Ozen's City Rain, Kireya's REM Sleep & many more, along with idle games like Idle Home by Maki. Are hit by this, because none of these creators made such a thing to happen. \n\nSo far, Group Private & Invite Only Instances do get affected by this. On 10/24/2024 to 10/25/2024 CST for 6 hours on Friends only, has yet to be affected, at the moment. No idea about the other settings nor if it will happen again on Friends only.\n\nIs it possible to change this to a longer instance age time for timer (up to 12 hours or something) if needed or removal of it in general?",
